Package: CanvasXpressBio
Title: CanvasXpress Visualizations for Bioconductor Data Structures
Version: 0.99.6
Authors@R:
    person("Isaac", "Neuhaus", email = "imnphd@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5622-8683"))
Description: Bridges the CanvasXpress interactive visualization library to core
    Bioconductor data structures. Provides a generic to render a
    SummarizedExperiment, and any class that extends it such as
    SingleCellExperiment or DESeqDataSet, as an interactive CanvasXpress heatmap
    that carries its row and column annotations, together with a volcano helper
    for differential-expression result tables. Charts are reproducible
    CanvasXpress widgets usable in R, R Markdown and Shiny.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
biocViews: Software, Visualization, GeneExpression, DifferentialExpression,
    RNASeq, SingleCell, Transcriptomics
